  "prefLabel": "En 1202.19 Utility service",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1202.19 \"Utility service\" means the provision of electric, gas, water, or sewer service in accordance with the terms and conditions of a tariff filed with and approved by the commission, or by a rural electric cooperative for which a certificate of deregulation is on file with the commission in accordance with its terms and conditions of service.\n\nSource. #13986, eff 5-30-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 1200)",
